e_name": "05_Faces_Selector_2560x1440.png", "id": "1288337783335827", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1288337786669160_4475558771986816353_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69ZjV7CUangQ7kNvwHNX0vt&_nc_oc=Adqhhl8WrEFjgYMOFgAv3MbV3lZ-vpWJmxrNdH5KqRR2HoPRVyoRLjE4LSOYc0tarWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPv365I5XwhITz126OaJcg0M867hNw74Kvaszb1dvgFGQ&oe=6ACA716D"}, {"file_name": "01_Barker_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "1821110108888468", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1821110112221801_8561623093088699699_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=03Kg20dREe0Q7kNvwGtdmDr&_nc_oc=Adq_1sYURIMmsocOXIFckiC6X9QXnYSPiUGsoCvuAviKuaiD__1bzCi9iycwZ6Usbc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOlNcY6guWgtQbDQOXvsk9G6b-gpvJyAsHEc_6XJD0o_A&oe=6ACA67CF"}, {"file_name": "03_Barker_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2620587385039026", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2620587388372359_8557321908904764527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B8omcOnwexwQ7kNvwEasA5O&_nc_oc=AdoCyYZXTSgEYOxdn0V47W7CbzY42RRvQxpy31PhEerExOgd4RSuFW9xgkb0l4_c7E8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNlz_NpzSwontpMuVG9dmQqbrgSOr3LDq_N235MVYbUIA&oe=6ACA6B7C"}, {"file_name": "02_Flexer_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "3167831576755462", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_3167831580088795_7645227145100028470_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pBBOBHY2g0wQ7kNvwGsqtyX&_nc_oc=AdpoF0e0kRIgASouzERIEom5BBT7tROX_Dl310TMvYB9FBq-WtkFR_wS7sgnaXBd1pg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOg-ldSCoduZKiBwg4mhq10LS5ZU_uHkftXgfgnJDiUBw&oe=6ACA758C"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zzpmaZbS0pkQ7kNvwEvazDa&_nc_oc=Adr4mM4bWdbbt_ABL3xFoQUmPURG7iy8Dxme9kQcn1d3_b6ib_7Q8_nAlLIgvIEAUSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN2iVz4_KmCGpUFkcDk4rXyYZXGWSRc7n8O3i9n70daiQ&oe=6ACA6693"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/contact", "website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/development", "category": n